    <textTemplates>
        <name>Inviteemail</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Dear {!$Record.Salutation} {!$Record.FirstName} {!$Record.LastName},&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;On behalf of the Wadhwani Foundation, &lt;strong&gt;Dr.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shirshendu&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mukherjee (Managing Director, Wadhwani Innovation Network) &lt;/strong&gt;has nominated you to join our esteemed expert panel for&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;evaluating R&amp;amp;D project proposals under &lt;strong&gt;Wadhwani Innovation Network (WIN).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Wadhwani Foundation&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://wadhwanifoundation.org/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(1, 118, 211);&quot;&gt;(www.wadhwanifoundation.org&lt;/a&gt;) has been actively working towards its&amp;nbsp;primary mission of accelerating economic development by driving job creation through various program initiatives in skilling, entrepreneurship, digital transformation, driven by research and innovation. Founded by Silicon Valley entrepreneur Dr. Romesh Wadhwani, the Foundation is scaling impact through programs that leverage the latest technology and network access of world-class resources to improve livelihoods and change lives through the application of technology and innovation. Dr. Romesh Wadhwani also serves on the Governing Board of the Anusandhan National Research Foundation (ANRF), Chaired by the Hon’ble PM of India.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Within this framework, the &lt;strong&gt;Wadhwani Innovation Network (WIN)&lt;/strong&gt; is aimed at accelerating India’s global innovation leadership by transforming academic research into impactful solutions by promoting techno-entrepreneurship by establishing Centres of Excellence (COEs) in leading institutions like IITs, IISc, C-CAMP and others, focusing on high-impact research areas such as Bio-engineering and Bio-Tech, HealthTech, Advance Computing and AI, Quantum, Critical Minerals and Mining. These WIN-COEs are aimed at transforming academic research into real-world solutions through techno‑entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Your expertise will play a pivotal role in evaluating R&amp;amp;D project proposals submitted by various WIN-COEs for potential funding. Your insights will help guide high-potential innovations toward successful outcomes. We truly appreciate the time and effort this involves, and please note that your contributions will be duly compensated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As part of the standard process, you will shortly receive an email with your login credentials and a link to our reviewer portal.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Upon acceptance, please log in to change your password and complete your registration. Upon registration, we will share a Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) for your signature. Once we receive the executed NDA, relevant project proposals will be assigned for your review.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;For any queries, please feel free to reach out to &lt;strong&gt;Ms. Shreya Malik, Program Head, WIN&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(Ph.No. 9971797659) &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;Ms. Mitika Kashyap, Program Manager, WIN (Ph.No. 9810991520)&lt;/strong&gt;, copied in this email.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Thank you for considering our request. We look forward to your positive response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Thanks and Warm Regards,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;WIN Management Team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
